Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: byteguru-compositor
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libwlroots-0.18, xkb-data,
 wl-clipboard, grim, slurp
Description: Wayland compositor for ByteguruOS (bgwl)
 wlroots-based session compositor: streams (workspaces) with per-stream
 accents, tile/even/floating layouts, real maximise and fullscreen,
 server-side titlebars with buttons, exclusive zones for the panel,
 ext-session-lock and idle handling, laptop lid, screencopy and the rest of
 the protocol set the portals and sandboxed apps need, plus a JSON control
 socket used by the shell and by bgctl.

Package: byteguru-shell
Architecture: all
Section: x11
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 python3 (>= 3.11),
 python3-gi,
 gir1.2-gtk-4.0,
 gir1.2-adw-1,
 gir1.2-gtk4layershell-1.0,
 libgtk4-layer-shell0,
 gsettings-desktop-schemas,
 adwaita-icon-theme,
 fonts-dejavu,
 byteguru-data,
 byteguru-apps-daemon,
 byteguru-compositor,
Recommends: network-manager, upower, pipewire, power-profiles-daemon,
 xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, thunar, foot
Description: ByteguruOS desktop shell
 Panel (streams, window list, machine indicators, quick settings), application
 launcher, settings window, first-run wizard, lock screen, session entry
 (bgwl-session) and bgctl. The state model is separated from the widgets and
 unit-tested; the widgets read the compositor over its control socket instead
 of keeping a second copy of the truth.

Package: byteguru-apps-daemon
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 python3 (>= 3.11)
Recommends: flatpak, byteguru-wincompat
Description: ByteguruOS session daemon with a unified application model
 Presents Flatpak apps, .desktop entries and WCV manifests as one list and
 returns an executable launch plan, including coverage level and sandbox
 warnings. WinCompat is an optional dependency: with it removed the system
 loses the ability to run Windows applications and stays a complete desktop.

Package: byteguru-wincompat
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 python3 (>= 3.11),
 apparmor, apparmor-utils, wine64 | wine, winetricks, ca-certificates
Description: WinCompat subsystem for running Windows applications
 WCV manifest validation, per-application prefixes with rollback, drive letter
 and path visibility filter, AppArmor/seccomp policy generation, coverage
 registry where a level is only published from recorded runs. This is an
 optional component: nothing else in the system imports it at runtime, and
 bgd treats its absence as "no Windows applications available".

Package: byteguru-installer
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 python3 (>= 3.11),
 python3-gi,
 gir1.2-gtk-4.0,
 partimage | ntfs-3g,
 gdisk, dosfstools, e2fsprogs, btrfs-progs, exfatprogs, efibootmgr,
 cryptsetup, debootstrap, squashfs-tools
Description: ByteguruOS installer with dual-boot support
 Disk layout planner working on contiguous free segments, safety gates
 (hibernation, BitLocker, dirty NTFS block the plan), EFI boot entry repair
 after Windows updates, a clock policy for machines with both systems, and a
 GTK front-end that runs the plan against a real device with confirmation.

Package: byteguru-data
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Data files for ByteguruOS
 Desktop entries, the Wayland session entry, systemd user units, the shell CSS
 themes and the example WCV manifests.
